The 2014 mainline offerings consist of 100 HW City, 40 HW Off-Road, 50 HW Race and 60 HW Workshop, for a total of 250 cars. Segments are comprised of 10 cars. See [[2014 New Models]] for a list of new models and [[2014 Treasure Hunts Series]] for a list of Treasure Hunts cars.

See also [[2014 New Models]]

